ing is ever that simple in the Backrooms: Clean each room as quickly as possible while avoiding increasingly deadly Incursions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Cleanup Crew currently has 14 playable levels and on average it takes 3 hours to experience all of the unique content. More levels will be added throughout Early Access.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/57006ab041222142dbf7a285147a1b46.poster.avif?t=1760976123\" width=1000 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/57006ab041222142dbf7a285147a1b46.webm?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/57006ab041222142dbf7a285147a1b46.mp4?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 3 other players to make quick work of cleaning a variety of levels. Switch between different nozzle types to suit the cleaning at hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/2135c0699d32f4a9faf73253393329ef.poster.avif?t=1760976123\" width=1000 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/2135c0699d32f4a9faf73253393329ef.webm?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/2135c0699d32f4a9faf73253393329ef.mp4?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to scrubbing walls, collect and bin all of the objects in the level. Don\u2019t worry about being gentle\u2014feel free to toss items across the room to speed up the process! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/b5fb930796b996c9eaf6b3a4cafea973.poster.avif?t=1760976123\" width=1000 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/b5fb930796b996c9eaf6b3a4cafea973.webm?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/b5fb930796b996c9eaf6b3a4cafea973.mp4?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware increasingly difficult and deadly Incursions - dodge between attacks while cleaning any glowing markings to prevent new attacks. Gain power from clearing these markings to make your cleaning even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/b34b4b8b7f91188dc8974f95c330ab9e.poster.avif?t=1760976123\" width=1000 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/b34b4b8b7f91188dc8974f95c330ab9e.webm?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/b34b4b8b7f91188dc8974f95c330ab9e.mp4?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the Normal game mode described above, Backrooms Cleanup Crew can be played on Hard and Peaceful modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/7cf21697fe047bcb4c4be6956043efbf.poster.avif?t=1760976123\" width=1000 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/7cf21697fe047bcb4c4be6956043efbf.webm?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/extras/7cf21697fe047bcb4c4be6956043efbf.mp4?t=1760976123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Cleanup Crew is developed by a two-person team with a love for co-op gaming. We're deeply grateful for your feedback and helping us make this game as fun as possible for you and your crew.</p>","developers":["On The Bridge Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140990/header.jpg?t=1760976123","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3140990/1782421816/67fc574a11f014164926ce751d7cdbfa33da08a3/1760725508/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760976116","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3140990/1782421816/67fc574a11f014164926ce751d7cdbfa33da08a3/1760725508/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760976116","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3140990/1782421816/67fc574a11f014164926ce751d7cdbfa33da08a3/1760725508/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760976116","id":257219368,"name":"Chapter 2 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219368/459535c5a25194992a66ed99c416c8cde59f7dae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760976116"},{"dash_av1":